#. 犯人を決めろっつってもよぉ…
msgctxt "0001 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"It's easy just to say,\n"
"\"Hey, decide who did it!\""
msgstr ""

#. もう、<CLT 9>新しい手掛かりがない<CLT>んだぜ？
msgctxt "0002 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "But there <CLT 9>just aren't any more clues<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ならば、<CLT 9>今までの手掛かり<CLT>を
#. もう１度見直そう！
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Very well! Then let's review <CLT 9>all the clues we've\n"
"found up to this point<CLT> one more time!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな時間があるのですか…？
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid "Do we really have time for all that...?"
msgstr ""

#. は、破滅…破滅よ…！
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "D-Die... Die!"
msgstr ""

#. このまま…
#. みんな破滅するのよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If we don't d-do something...\n"
"we're all g-gonna die!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>手掛かり手掛かり手掛かり…<CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Clues...clues...clues...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>誰かいねーのかよ…！<CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Isn't there anything!?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>うーむむむむむ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hrm-hrm-hrm...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>はあ！？　また？<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>What? Again!?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>他に方法はないのか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Is there really nothing else?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>何を見直すの…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>What's left to look at?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>終わっちまうぞ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>It's all over!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
